			"Message": "chore(Worker): Use POSIX-compliant sh shebang in build scripts\n\nReplace bash-specific shebang with POSIX-compliant sh in Worker build scripts for improved cross-platform compatibility. Changed:\n- Source/Run.sh: #!/usr/bin/env bash → #!/usr/bin/env sh\n- Source/prepublishOnly.sh: #!/usr/bin/env bash → #!/usr/bin/env sh\n\nThe POSIX sh shell is more universally available across different Unix-like systems (Linux, macOS, BSD) and ensures consistent behavior without requiring bash as a dependency.",
